  "body": "**Description:**\r\n\r\n<!-- Describe here the feature you are requesting. -->\r\n\r\nI found out that any picture/media that was removed in the chat history (Element) still exists in the \"/data/media_store\", and the files are no longer needed anymore but consumes a lot of disk space.\r\n\r\nSo is there any way to clean all the local content that does not link to any chat room or history?\r\n\r\nI'm aware of there is a media_admin_api, but that will also remove all the media that is still **used** by chat history, point is I don't want to jeopardize any history but only remove the files that are not needed.",
